    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>## 节目简介</span></p><span></span><p><span>**本期口播🎙️：** 爸爸的机器人小哥哥🤖</span></p><span></span><p><span>**本期简介📄：** 怎么学好英语，就是"用"！💬📚✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a> 逐字阅读，慢慢品味：为什么读书速度不等于阅读质量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">00:04:02</a> 克服阅读焦虑，掌握精读技巧，开启思考之门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">00:06:02</a> 掌握逻辑思考能力的关键：害怕受到惩罚的根源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">00:08:43</a> 深入解析模式识别与阅读理解的关系：错误的模式导致错误的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">00:11:37</a> 阅读理解之谜：为何那些读懂的部分实际毫无意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">00:14:32</a> 如何有效阅读：揭示文本背后的关系网络</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">00:17:25</a> 阅读速度的秘密：为什么有的孩子能读快而有的孩子读慢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">00:20:12</a> 多懂一门语言的好处：探索语言交流的深度和广度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">00:23:12</a> Animal Farm与精神上的自由：一本被禁掉的书籍的启示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">00:26:09</a> 阅读的力量：从哥白尼到爱因斯坦的知识积累之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">00:29:05</a> 经典书籍的可靠来源：Google书库和自定义搜索引擎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1914">00:31:54</a> 开启逻辑思维的大门：Critical Thinking 思考之道</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>文本内容来自于github仓库：</span><a href="https://github.com/xiaolai/everyone-can-use-english" data-url="https://github.com/xiaolai/everyone-can-use-english"><span>github.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frb3PZsF54bM6UIaIpBYjECJEw-C.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Devil's face in the smoke. A famous photo on 9-11 attack.</span></p><span></span><