    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Feb 2024 13:17:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>**本期口播🎙️：** 爸爸的机器人小哥哥🤖</span></p><span></span><p><span>**本期简介📄：** 怎么学好英语，就是"用"！💬📚✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a> 一切学习的奇迹：通过自学成为学霸的奥秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">00:04:04</a> 地球上所有语言的原因都被标注，揭秘口腔内气流共振的位置！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">00:06:08</a> 成年人学习外语：从新建神经元连接到强化连接的桃战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">00:08:09</a> 如何通过练习调整口腔内气流共鸣位置，提高英语口语能力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">00:10:10</a> 如何准确发音英语辅音：舌尖起始位置的关键！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">00:12:13</a> 如何在APP中正确发音？掌握舌尖奇石位置和口腔共鸣的关键！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">00:14:13</a> 如何在英语中准确表达意思：重视音韵与语调的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>地球上所有语言中出现过的 “元音” 的 “国际音标”（IPA，</span><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPA_vowel_chart_with_audio" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPA_vowel_chart_with_audio"><span>wikipedia</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3uJp4j59f0fvgbVwLbyzJRrXnV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>以下是 “英语” 的 “元音” 在发声的时候 “</span><strong><span>口腔内气流共振的位置</span></strong><span>”（即，把其它语言的元音都给去掉）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft3qTrdzZ7rLUIrAy4YdkIKwskWH.png"></figure><span></span><p><code><span>θ</span></code><span>, </span><code><span>ð</span></code><span> 这两个音的舌尖起始位置：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhYtUi8uI_VEK2VCgMyNKNhoXFLU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnR8DoNJH3yKPSmUni9bWpBwRMxl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>文本内容来自于github仓库：</span><a href="https://github.com/xiaolai/everyone-can-use-english" data-url="https://github.com/xiaolai/everyone-can-use-english"><span>github.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
