  <item>
    <title>10.心理建设</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bcf82235dd8780ed6fb726</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bcf82235dd8780ed6fb726</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Feb 2024 14:11:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>## 节目简介</span></p><span></span><p><span>**本期口播🎙️：** 爸爸的机器人小哥哥🤖</span></p><span></span><p><span>**本期简介📄：** 怎么学好英语，就是"用"！💬📚✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:00:19</a> 语言学习关键期，谬论曾行其道，现有真正合理解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">00:01:25</a> 大脑设定的“效能阀值”高，对“可有可无”之物漠不关心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">00:03:14</a> 没有动机就没有关注，进而没有注意力投入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">00:05:39</a> 做好心理建设，总是无往不利，势不可挡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">00:08:32</a> 蓝牙耳机电量有限，每只耳朵都有休息时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">00:08:53</a> 人类身体器官比自以为的“皮实”更为脆弱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">00:10:54</a> 健脑比健身更重要，等你活到一定岁数就明白了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">00:11:58</a> 进取型人格比固守型人格更重要，关注自身成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">00:13:52</a> 小动作让自己掉入“固守型人格”的陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">00:14:35</a> 多关注自己的成长，体会到“进步”的几乎唯一来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">00:14:59</a> 他们最缺的不是方法、技巧、天分、智商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">00:15:32</a> 任务是父母带孩子一起做，榜样散发着信息素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">00:17:22</a> 不断培养它，强化它，到最后它就是你，你就是它</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>文本内容来自于github仓库：</span><a href="https://github.com/xiaolai/everyone-can-use-english" data-url="https://github.com/xiaolai/everyone-can-use-english"><span>github.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgbv0RwMAiI13rpQIyYKUhha63sf.m4a" length="9319618" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:14:53</itunes:duration>
